      "device": "/dev/nvme0n1",
      "type": "NVMe SSD",
      "size": "465.8 GB (457G formatted)",
      "partitions": [
        {"name": "nvme0n1p1", "size": "1 GB"},
        {"name": "nvme0n1p2", "size": "464.7 GB", "mount": "/dsh-home (overlay /)"}
      ],
      "used": "134 GB (31%)",
      "available": "300 GB"
    }
  ],
  "gpu": [
    {
      "name": "Intel Graphics (PCI ID 8086:E223)",
      "driver": "xe (Intel Xe driver)"
    },
    {
      "name": "AMD Radeon RX 7900 XTX / gfx1100 family (PCI ID 1002:744C)",
      "driver": "amdgpu"
    }
  ],
  "system": {
    "vendor": "ASUS",
    "product_name": "System Product Name",
    "note": "运行于容器环境（overlay 根文件系统），GPU 未安装 CUDA/nvidia-smi，AMD 卡走 amdgpu 驱动"
  }
}
```

补充说明：
- **GPU**：检测到两张显卡——Intel 核显（PCI `8086:E223`，Xe 驱动）和 AMD 独显（PCI `1002:744C`，amdgpu 驱动）。未安装 `nvidia-smi`/CUDA，因此无法读取 GPU 显存占用等运行时指标。
- **环境**：根文件系统为 overlay，且 `/dev/shm` 仅 64M、存在多个 tmpfs 挂载，符合容器（如 Docker/Podman）特征；上面的信息反映的是宿主机硬件。

